{"4884610":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Wend","steam_appid":4884610,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","dlc":[5272020],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tower defense game with a heavy focus on mazing. Includes a campaign, ranked PVP, and an endless PVE mode you can play solo or with up to 4 players in co-op. New maps are generated daily, weekly and monthly so you will never run out of content! We hope you enjoy it!<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4884610\/extras\/590886369f785b028e0b2298d66c7964.avif?t=1793668320\" width=1232 height=255 \/><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4884610\/extras\/8c67c1d080c7735365ff98e1de87792e.poster.avif?t=1793668320\" width=1170 height=684 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4884610\/extras\/8c67c1d080c7735365ff98e1de87792e.webm?t=1793668320\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4884610\/extras\/8c67c1d080c7735365ff98e1de87792e.mp4?t=1793668320\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your maze before each round starts<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every tower you place shapes the path<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The enemies must hit multiple checkpoints before leaving<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Limited supply will make sure you optimize your maze<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zones around the board give your towers buffs and your enemies debuffs<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4884610\/extras\/b135ca5ec650da43b4d49830fcbf7634.avif?t=1793668320\" width=1232 height=218 \/><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4884610\/extras\/cbcdcb27f73393eb7a6e7a18c456b963.avif?t=1793668320\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4884610\/extras_big\/cbcdcb27f73393eb7a6e7a18c456b963.webp?t=1793668320 width=1560 height=877 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story campaign with tons of maps with multiple biomes<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PVP - compete with up to 8 players in a ranked mode and climb the leaderboards<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PVE - an endless mode for solo players or with up to 4 people in online co-op<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4884610\/extras\/0d99ad408e3947a4659be81606a9dd50.avif?t=1793668320\" width=1232 height=246 \/><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4884610\/extras\/1d5c40fcc693b24bce7c3c3bc3aee670.poster.avif?t=1793668320\" width=1170 height=730 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4884610\/extras\/1d5c40fcc693b24bce7c3c3bc3aee670.webm?t=1793668320\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4884610\/extras\/1d5c40fcc693b24bce7c3c3bc3aee670.mp4?t=1793668320\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every match in PVP is procedurally generated, meaning no two matches are ever the same.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless mode has multiple maps that change every day, week and month <\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tower defense game with a heavy focus on mazing. Includes a campaign, ranked PVP, and an endless PVE mode you can play solo or with up to 4 players in co-op. New maps are generated daily, weekly and monthly so you will never run out of content! We hope you enjoy it!<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4884610\/extras\/590886369f785b028e0b2298d66c7964.avif?t=1793668320\" width=1232 height=255 \/><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4884610\/extras\/8c67c1d080c7735365ff98e1de87792e.poster.avif?t=1793668320\" width=1170 height=684 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4884610\/extras\/8c67c1d080c7735365ff98e1de87792e.webm?t=1793668320\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4884610\/extras\/8c67c1d080c7735365ff98e1de87792e.mp4?t=1793668320\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your maze before each round starts<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every tower you place shapes the path<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The enemies must hit multiple checkpoints before leaving<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Limited supply will make sure you optimize your maze<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zones around the board give your towers buffs and your enemies debuffs<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4884610\/extras\/b135ca5ec650da43b4d49830fcbf7634.avif?t=1793668320\" width=1232 height=218 \/><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4884610\/extras\/cbcdcb27f73393eb7a6e7a18c456b963.avif?t=1793668320\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4884610\/extras_big\/cbcdcb27f73393eb7a6e7a18c456b963.webp?t=1793668320 width=1560 height=877 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story campaign with tons of maps with multiple biomes<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PVP - compete with up to 8 players in a ranked mode and climb the leaderboards<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PVE - an endless mode for solo players or with up to 4 people in online co-op<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4884610\/extras\/0d99ad408e3947a4659be81606a9dd50.avif?t=1793668320\" width=1232 height=246 \/><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4884610\/extras\/1d5c40fcc693b24bce7c3c3bc3aee670.poster.avif?t=1793668320\" width=1170 height=730 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4884610\/extras\/1d5c40fcc693b24bce7c3c3bc3aee670.webm?t=1793668320\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4884610\/extras\/1d5c40fcc693b24bce7c3c3bc3aee670.mp4?t=1793668320\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every match in PVP is procedurally generated, meaning no two matches are ever the same.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless mode has multiple maps that change every day, week and month <\/p>","s